    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nSherry FitzGerald Reilly are delighted to present a unique, spacious detached residence extending to 325 sq m. (3,500 sq ft) of well proportioned and imaginative designed accommodation with a large private courtyard and carport on approx 0.33 hectare/0.80 acre of mature grounds in a delightful unspoilt, rustic setting with convenience of Johnstown Bridge, Enfield, Kilcock and the M4 motorway.\n\nYou must view this home to fully appreciate its wonderful features, generous split level layout and huge potential. It currently offers approximately 3,500 sq. ft. of accommodation with a further approximately 1,200 sq. ft. of space suitable for conversion conditional on normal planning requirements. This is a property with unique features and attractive finishes enveloping a large courtyard in which to relax on long sunny days. It is located in a tranquil rural setting close to Knockanally Golf Club, a number of villages and towns where all essential amenities are available and convenient to the M4 motorway providing easy access to Dublin City and \n\nThis is a rare opportunity to acquire a wonderful family home in an unspoilt yet convenient setting. Viewing is highly recommended by prior appointment."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Accommodation",
        "SortOrder": 1,
        "Content": "\nEntrance Hall - 6.7m x 3.7m\nSplit level with porcelain tiled flooring, vaulted ceiling, French doors to rear.\n\nLounge - 5.8m x 5.5m\nWith feature fireplace, sunken floor, tiled flooring, vaulted ceiling, recessed display units.\n\nKitchen Dining Room - 8.7m x 8.0m\nOpen plan split level area with triple aspect, high glossed fitted kitchen, gas hob, two electric ovens, microwave, integrated dishwasher, integrated fridge, tiled and laminate flooring, extractor hood, island, vaulted ceiling, recessed lighting, wood burning stove, French door to deck area.\n\nUtility Room - 2.1m x 1.1m\nWith washing machine, fitted storage units, tiled floor.\n\nWet Room - 2.4m x 1.6m\nWith shower, wc, whb, tiled floor, tiled walls, heated towel rail, recessed lighting.\n\nCorridor - 3.4m x 1.6m\nWith porcelain tiled flooring, feature staircase, under stairs storage.\n\nBedroom 1 - 4.7m x 2.6m\nWith carpet, french door to side.\n\nBedroom 2 - 3.9m x 2.7m\nWith carpet.\n\nBedroom 3 - 5.9m x 5.8m\nWith dual aspect, fitted wardrobes/dresser and carpet.\n\nEn-Suite - 3.9m x 2.4m\nWith bath, jet shower, wc, whb, tiled floor, tiled walls, shower screen, heated towel rail, mirror, recessed lighting.\n\nLobby - 3.9m x 2.5m\nWith laminate flooring, recessed lighting, airing cupboard, access to courtyard.\n\nFirst Floor - \n\n\nBedroom 4 - 4.7m x 3.4m\nWith carpet, closets, roof window.\n\nBedroom 5 - 4.7m x 3.4m\nWith carpet, roof window.\n\nBedroom 6 - 5.7m x 5.2m\nWith carpet/laminate flooring, vaulted ceiling, access to attic space with potential for ensuite/dressing room.\n\nBathroom - 3.4m x 2.8m\nWith Jet shower, wc, vanity whb, tiled floor, tiled walls, shower screen, radiator cabinet, recessed lighting, roof window.\n\nGallery - 3.4m x 2.6m\nWith laminate flooring, vaulted ceiling.\n\nLanding - 13.9m x 2.3m\nWith laminate flooring, airing cupboard, Acoustic paneling.\n\n"
      },
      {
